---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Atriveo | Independent Products Built in Public"
  description="Atriveo is an independent product ecosystem by Atishay Kasliwal, built around clear workflows, grounded intelligence, useful software, and open work."
>
  <section class="page-hero about-hero section-shell">
    <p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-mark"></span> About Atriveo</p>
    <h1>Small systems can solve<br /><em>large amounts of friction.</em></h1>
    <p>
      Atriveo is an independent collection of products by Atishay Kasliwal. The projects span different
      domains, but share one job: make complicated work easier to understand and act on.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section-shell about-statement">
    <p class="statement-index">01 / THESIS</p>
    <blockquote>
      “The best tool is not the one with the most intelligence. It is the one that leaves the user with the most clarity.”
    </blockquote>
  </section>

  <section class="section-shell section-block principles-section">
    <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">How the work is approached</p><h2>A repeatable operating loop.</h2></div></div>
    <div class="principle-cards">
      <article><span>01</span><h3>Find repeated friction.</h3><p>Start with work that is already happening and costs attention every time.</p></article>
      <article><span>02</span><h3>Make the system legible.</h3><p>Model the real workflow, expose useful state, and remove avoidable decisions.</p></article>
      <article><span>03</span><h3>Ship the smallest whole thing.</h3><p>Deliver an end-to-end product before expanding the surface.</p></article>
      <article><span>04</span><h3>Open the useful parts.</h3><p>Publish source and reasoning when doing so helps others build with confidence.</p></article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-shell final-cta about-cta">
    <div><p class="eyebrow">See the system</p><h2>Explore what is live,<br />and what is becoming.</h2></div>
    <a class="button button-inverse" href="/projects">Browse all projects <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
